    "detailed_description": "Welcome to Mythical Ruins, an epic adventure brought to life in the Unreal Engine! Plunge into a world full of secrets and challenges, without the hassle of quests or tedious reading. It's all about exploring the world on your own, fighting a variety of enemies and surviving in different biomes.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExperience a Soulslike experience where you can constantly improve your skills as you fight your way through the mystical ruins. Venture into the hardcore area for even more intense challenges or explore the different biomes and discover their secrets.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPrepare yourself for an adventure full of excitement, tactics and unforgettable battles in Mythical Ruins. Are you ready to push your limits and discover the legends of this forgotten world?",
